WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.297 --> 00:00:07.424
What seems to be the
problem, Charlie Brown?

00:00:07.758 --> 00:00:10.219
I haven't completed any of my
New Year's resolutions.

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:12.471
Good grief.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.974
Your grandma didn't come
for Christmas this year

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:17.434
and Lucy took it pretty hard.

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.102
She thought it was
because of her.

00:00:19.478 --> 00:00:20.562
You are loveable

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:22.564
and I know just how to prove it.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.650
I'm going to throw a party,

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:25.943
and you're going to help.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.362
What did I just get myself into?

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:30.906
Everyone should dress up,

00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:33.033
be on time,

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.202
and good manners only.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.372
Elegant perfection.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.256
No one is having fun.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:49.591
[Screams]

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:51.468
Charlie Brown,

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:53.720
how do you manage 
to keep going 

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.930
when life gets you down?

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.557
No matter how bad
things may seem,

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.645
I can always rely on my friends.

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:04.940
♪ Should old acquaintance ♪

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.566
I'm not sure if we're
doing it justice.

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:07.818
I wrote some of my own.

00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:11.571
♪ One thing should never be

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:16.326
forgot Lucy's party
blew my mind ♪ Really?

